@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5044

# Sample requests for the Visual Studio / VS Code REST Client. Run "login" first: the staff requests below send its token.
# The username and password are the dev logins from appsettings.Development.json (StaffAccounts).

# @name login
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

###

@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Public: the menu

GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Public: place a pay-at-counter takeout order (the server looks up prices and the total)

POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fulfillmentType": "Takeout",
  "paymentMethod": "Counter",
  "customerName": "Ada",
  "customerPhone": "08012345678",
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### Staff: orders

GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/orders?status=Pending
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/orders/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

PUT {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

"Completed"

###

POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/orders/1/mark-paid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: sales report for a date range in a time zone

GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/orders/report?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-01-31&timeZone=Africa/Lagos
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
